{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_E806F571","title":"Something to be Remembered By","entry":"Dlg_E806F571::entry","exit":"Dlg_E806F571::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_49C87FBA","articyId":"72057778721533040","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Do you know what cements a person's place in history?","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do you know what cements a person's place in history?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-175.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48789","byteOffset":32795328,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_76175742","articyId":"72057778721533074","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Eventually, someone will come along and steal the spotlight, basking in the glow of their fifteen seconds of fame.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Eventually, someone will come along and steal the spotlight, basking in the glow of their fifteen seconds of fame.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":750.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33305","byteOffset":20484104,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_F5A8BF47","articyId":"72057778721533095","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"It was when attention spans were a thing.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It was when attention spans were a thing.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50654","byteOffset":33503504,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_0CCEAE20","articyId":"72057778721533104","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Pffft. If you are the kind of person who counts the amount of friends they, or anyone else, has then you have been brainwashed to believe relationships are a commodity. Congratulations.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pffft. If you are the kind of person who counts the amount of friends they, or anyone else, has then you have been brainwashed to believe relationships are a commodity. Congratulations.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"26324","byteOffset":17839864,"byteLength":500}},{"id":"DFr_709DD2D4","articyId":"72057778721533112","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Yes, because currency is something you can certainly bring with you when you die...","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, because currency is something you can certainly bring with you when you die...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":800.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42189","byteOffset":30288912,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_C8094A1C","articyId":"72057778721533121","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"The physical presence they leave on the world. Their FOOTPRINT.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The physical presence they leave on the world. Their FOOTPRINT.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1925.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36176","byteOffset":28032768,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_5317D8BA","articyId":"72057778721533142","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"I'm talking something more... designer. Monuments. Tombs. Palaces that reflect their tastes, their personality.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm talking something more... designer. Monuments. Tombs. Palaces that reflect their tastes, their personality.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":2525.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29836","byteOffset":19168912,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_841887DB","articyId":"72057778721533163","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Correct. Unless you're part of the corporate class. Then you can build monuments that touch the very edge of space. But we're going to change that!","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Correct. Unless you're part of the corporate class. Then you can build monuments that touch the very edge of space. But we're going to change that!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3712.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38132","byteOffset":28760688,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_2320BC12","articyId":"72057778721533190","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Listen to me: I have studied history and ages that time itself has forgotten. My life has been dedicated to understanding the myriad complications of our past.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Listen to me: I have studied history and ages that time itself has forgotten. My life has been dedicated to understanding the myriad complications of our past.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4325.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29455","byteOffset":19022016,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_15F482EE","articyId":"72057778721533224","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"You and your keen eye are going to help me build a palace of knowledge. A place of intellect.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You and your keen eye are going to help me build a palace of knowledge. A place of intellect.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5225.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50349","byteOffset":33389272,"byteLength":440}},{"id":"DFr_24143315","articyId":"72057778721533246","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Be that as it may, consider yourself fully recruited and tasked. I want this place to shine like the inside of the world's greatest libraries. You know, before someone inevitably comes around and burns or bans them.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Be that as it may, consider yourself fully recruited and tasked. I want this place to shine like the inside of the world's greatest libraries. You know, before someone inevitably comes around and burns or bans them.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5825.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"25804","byteOffset":17644800,"byteLength":560}},{"id":"DFr_3DF04616","articyId":"72057778721533268","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Excellent! Come find me when you're done!","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Excellent! Come find me when you're done!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":7025.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49907","byteOffset":33223040,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_630A6578","articyId":"72057778721533275","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Moronic assholes generally accept the task.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Moronic assholes generally accept the task.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6425.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19366","byteOffset":15211592,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_D5D951B0","articyId":"72057821671326565","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"Pfft. Do you truly think anyone cares about the actions of others? If they do, it's only when it effects them directly and-or if there's a lull in the news.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Pfft. Do you truly think anyone cares about the actions of others? If they do, it's only when it effects them directly and-or if there's a lull in the news.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":425.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31979","byteOffset":19979712,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_67339408","articyId":"72057821671326573","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"People marvel at these things throughout the ages. Write papers about them. Host live streams dissecting what it is that makes them so interesting.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"People marvel at these things throughout the ages. Write papers about them. Host live streams dissecting what it is that makes them so interesting.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3125.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42927","byteOffset":30570888,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_ACA356BC","articyId":"72057821671326596","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Professor Kasey Remo","text":"And damn it, I will not have that fade to nothing when I'm gone.","speakerId":"Ntt_137D526B","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And damn it, I will not have that fade to nothing when I'm gone.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":4625.0,"y":600.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45205","byteOffset":31435544,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_D997E9BD","articyId":"72057778721533053","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Their actions?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Their actions?","TextSheVersion":"Their actions?","TextTheyVersion":"Their actions?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":125.0,"y":325.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44796","byteOffset":31281144,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_BBEF38DF","articyId":"72057778721533059","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The amount of friends they make?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The amount of friends they make?","TextSheVersion":"The amount of friends they make?","TextTheyVersion":"The amount of friends they make?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":125.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23468","byteOffset":16757432,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_3146C4E5","articyId":"72057778721533065","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"The wealth they accrue before death.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The wealth they accrue before death.","TextSheVersion":"The wealth they accrue before death.","TextTheyVersion":"The wealth they accrue before death."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":125.0,"y":775.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32953","byteOffset":20352008,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_7875D640","articyId":"72057778721533082","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Isn't it fifteen minutes of fame?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Isn't it fifteen minutes of fame?","TextSheVersion":"Isn't it fifteen minutes of fame?","TextTheyVersion":"Isn't it fifteen minutes of fame?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"23480","byteOffset":16762248,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_2159E285","articyId":"72057778721533089","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"So what marks a person's place in history then?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"So what marks a person's place in history then?","TextSheVersion":"So what marks a person's place in history then?","TextTheyVersion":"So what marks a person's place in history then?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1625.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28690","byteOffset":18737072,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_E1CADBD3","articyId":"72057778721533128","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Isn't that the same as their actions?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Isn't that the same as their actions?","TextSheVersion":"Isn't that the same as their actions?","TextTheyVersion":"Isn't that the same as their actions?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39626","byteOffset":29320520,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_1C1FAE58","articyId":"72057778721533134","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Their footprint?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Their footprint?","TextSheVersion":"Their footprint?","TextTheyVersion":"Their footprint?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2225.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34411","byteOffset":20901472,"byteLength":296}},{"id":"DFr_EEC72355","articyId":"72057778721533150","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't think CorpSec gives out those kinds of permits any more.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't think CorpSec gives out those kinds of permits any more.","TextSheVersion":"I don't think CorpSec gives out those kinds of permits any more.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't think CorpSec gives out those kinds of permits any more."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3425.0,"y":575.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39400","byteOffset":29235952,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_DB46CB0F","articyId":"72057778721533176","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"We are?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"We are?","TextSheVersion":"We are?","TextTheyVersion":"We are?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":450.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17831","byteOffset":14634552,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_D022C547","articyId":"72057778721533182","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I don't think so.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I don't think so.","TextSheVersion":"I don't think so.","TextTheyVersion":"I don't think so."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4025.0,"y":700.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31790","byteOffset":19906448,"byteLength":300}},{"id":"DFr_A6FC98E4","articyId":"72057778721533210","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What are you proposing?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What are you proposing?","TextSheVersion":"What are you proposing?","TextTheyVersion":"What are you proposing?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4925.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47590","byteOffset":32341816,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_83C070D9","articyId":"72057778721533216","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Can't you find someone else?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Can't you find someone else?","TextSheVersion":"Can't you find someone else?","TextTheyVersion":"Can't you find someone else?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":4925.0,"y":725.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50510","byteOffset":33449872,